       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-CENTENNIAL-CLOSURE.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-CENTENNIAL-THEOREMS.
           05  WS-WILCOXON-SIGNIFICANCE-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MULTIPLICATIVE-DECOMP-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-STATIONARY-RESIDUAL-WGN  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GENERALIZATION-PAC-BOUND PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-100TH-CENTENNIAL-SEAL-OK PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-CENTENNIAL-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-100-THEOREMS-PROVEN  PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-CENTENNIAL-CODE    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-STATISTICS-AND-MULTIPLICATIVE.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-STATIONARITY-AND-PAC.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-CENTENNIAL-SEAL.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-STATISTICS-AND-MULTIPLICATIVE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-WILCOXON-SIGNIFICANCE-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MULTIPLICATIVE-DECOMP-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-STATIONARITY-AND-PAC.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-STATIONARY-RESIDUAL-WGN.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GENERALIZATION-PAC-BOUND.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-CENTENNIAL-SEAL.
           IF WS-WILCOXON-SIGNIFICANCE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-MULTIPLICATIVE-DECOMP-OK = 1 AND
              WS-STATIONARY-RESIDUAL-WGN = 1 AND
              WS-GENERALIZATION-PAC-BOUND = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-100TH-CENTENNIAL-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-100-THEOREMS-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-CENTENNIAL-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-100-THEOREMS-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-CENTENNIAL-CODE.
